{"duration_api_ms":112447,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6f6e9345-0145-4752-b3a3-7261fc0947e3","total_cost_usd":0.186166,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16418,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":12049,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":6589},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16418,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12049,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16418,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16418},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12049,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16418,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.186166,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":6589,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is effectively a one-parameter curve in flight_path_angle at D=3.385, bluntness=1.2, cone=70. Flux rises from 227k W/m2 at -1.5 deg to 274.6k at -3.5703 deg, and bondline T falls from 417.9 K to 391.1 K. Diameter is capped by heatshield_mass_fraction (margin about 1.4e-4). Gamma is capped by max_g at about -3.5703 deg. Bluntness above 1.2, or cone or D below the corner, hits the cd_fore convex-hull refusal or a geometry failure. Hypervolume gains have fallen to about 1e-5 per round, so the last 25 evaluations fill gaps in the curve and probe the tiny remaining D and b headroom.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-948029610632 to C-8efe13d24286: at D=3.385, b=1.2, cone=70, gamma from -1.5 to -3.5703 gives flux 227k to 275k W/m2 and T 417.9 to 391.1 K, with max_g reaching 12.0 at -3.5703.\",\"C-8efe13d24286 has max_g margin 3.2e-5, and C-112b974177e0 (D=3.38, gamma -3.572) violates max_g. Gamma is therefore pinned near -3.570.\",\"C-948029610632 has mass margin 1.449e-4 and C-013d6de46fd0 (D=3.384) has 7.356e-4. That slope puts the mass limit near D=3.38525, so D=3.3851 to 3.3852 should stay feasible.\",\"C-a554636d8035, C-bcce2808c9b8, C-2375647d7e43, C-3d41ce848a30, C-dcc9bfd9f503 and C-166a3a760ccb all fail on cd_fore extrapolation. b>1.2 or cone<70 combined with D away from 3.385 is unsafe, so I keep the corner values.\",\"Gamma gaps on the curve with no evaluated point at D=3.385 and cone=70: -1.5 to -1.7, -1.95 to -2.35, -2.35 to -2.7, -2.7 to -3.05 and -3.1 to -3.4 (C-13574164271b, C-2f9f349729bd, C-af77f965ad8e).\"],\"mechanism\":\"This relies partly on prior Allen-Eggers-type reasoning and partly on the data. At the mass-limited corner (D, b, cone), flux and bondline T depend mainly on gamma. Steeper entry raises peak flux through sqrt(sin gamma) and shortens the heat pulse, which lowers the integrated load and bondline T. The g limit caps steepness. Local linear interpolation of the neighbouring evaluated points gives the predicted flux and T. Since D, b and cone are pinned by constraints, the only remaining upside is interpolation in gamma and a tiny D increase (about +0.0002 m).\",\"uncertainty\":\"The main uncertainty is whether D=3.3851 to 3.3852 or b=1.201 triggers the cd_fore hull refusal or violates the mass fraction. The gain from either is negligible. Predictions from interpolation should be accurate to about 0.1 percent in flux and 0.1 K in T. Max_g near -3.57 deg is marginal.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between -1.5 and -1.7 at the corner geometry.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229210,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":416.24,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds a front point in a sparsely covered gamma interval.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolation point between -1.8 and -1.95.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235400,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap on the convex front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolation point between -1.95 and -2.125.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.05},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":238700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.26,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap on the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint between -2.2 and -2.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.275},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":243790,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":406.06,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -2.35 and -2.5 at the corner geometry.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.45},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":247840,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.71,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the -2.35 to -2.7 interval.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint between -2.5 and -2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251360,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.79,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the gap between -2.5 and -2.7.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -2.7 and -3.05, where the gap is 0.35 deg.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.8},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256110,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.36,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the largest gamma gap on the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Second point in the -2.7 to -3.05 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":258500,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":398.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies a sparse interval.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -2.9 and -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.95},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds a front point at the corner geometry (cone=70) near -3.0.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -3.1 and -3.2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":264470,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.37,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap on the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.385 at gamma -3.2. The earlier point C-013d6de46fd0 used D=3.384.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.2},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":265680,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.84,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap and gives a small improvement over the D=3.384 point.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between -3.2 and -3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.25},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266885,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.31,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -3.3 and -3.4.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.35},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269295,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.27,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a gap in the -3.3 to -3.4 interval.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.385, cone=70 at gamma -3.5. Earlier -3.5 points used D=3.384 and cone<70.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.77,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds a corner-geometry point near the g-limited end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -3.52 and -3.54.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.53},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273620,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.48,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fine resolution near the g cap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -3.54 and -3.56.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274100,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.29,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fine resolution near the g cap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-8efe13d24286\",\"rationale\":\"Tiny D increase toward the mass-fraction limit, with gamma backed off slightly from the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5695},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274550,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the D headroom up to 3.38525 gives a small improvement at the extreme end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Tiny D increase at the flux-minimum end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.86,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"May marginally dominate C-948029610632 if the mass margin stays positive.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at a mid-front gamma of -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":248980,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.04,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the D headroom in the middle of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Probe of a tiny bluntness increase, since the hull failures appeared only at b>=1.205.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"bluntness_ratio\":1.201,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.75,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether the b limit is slightly above 1.2. A failure is informative but costs a slot.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":260880,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.01,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the D headroom on the steeper half of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -3.4.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":270480,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.75,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"A tiny improvement candidate over C-af77f965ad8e.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3852 at gamma -2.0. The earlier -2.0 point used cone 69.8.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":237570,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":409.98,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gives a slightly better point than the cone-69.8 one at the same gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"Between -1.5 and -1.7 near the shallow end.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.05,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the shallow end of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-948029610632\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3851 at gamma -3.56, with a small D increase.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3851,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.56},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274320,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.19,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the D headroom near the g cap with less mass-margin risk.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":71984,"type":"